{"seq":1,"slug":"solar-system-formation","title":"太阳系形成","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/planetary-science/solar-system-formation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"protoplanetary-disk","title":"原行星盘：太阳系的诞生摇篮","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/planetary-science/solar-system-formation/protoplanetary-disk","wordCount":1633,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"planet-formation-models","title":"行星形成模型：从尘埃到行星","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/planetary-science/solar-system-formation/planet-formation-models","wordCount":2057,"readingTime":9},{"seq":3,"slug":"small-bodies-meteorites","title":"小天体与陨石：太阳系的化石记录","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/planetary-science/solar-system-formation/small-bodies-meteorites","wordCount":2012,"readingTime":9}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"太阳系形成\">太阳系形成</h1><p>本章系统阐述太阳系从分子云坍缩到行星系统形成的完整过程。通过原行星盘物理、行星形成的核心模型，以及小天体和陨石提供的实证约束，构建对太阳系起源的深入理解。</p>\n<h2 id=\"章节内容\">章节内容</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>文档</th>\n<th>主题</th>\n<th>要点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>原行星盘</td>\n<td>盘结构与演化</td>\n<td>最小质量太阳星云、盘耗散机制、ALMA观测约束</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行星形成模型</td>\n<td>核吸积与盘不稳定性</td>\n<td>寡头增长、大碰撞阶段、Nice模型与Grand Tack</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>小天体与陨石</td>\n<td>太阳系化石记录</td>\n<td>陨石分类、同位素定年、小行星带动力学</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"核心问题\">核心问题</h2><ul>\n<li>太阳系的初始条件如何决定了行星系统的最终构型？</li>\n<li>行星迁移如何重塑了太阳系的轨道架构？</li>\n<li>陨石中保存的什么信息能约束早期太阳系的热历史和时间线？</li>\n</ul>\n"}